{"w":2400,"h":3395,"lines":[{"w":0.076920827229817745,"t":"Reading","x":0.83498228419247633,"y":0.10977213286776799,"c":1,"h":0.017911933476568165},{"y":0.15303890234374973,"t":"Questions 9-13","h":0.015728678663992968,"x":0.17879347999933221,"w":0.14245960235595706,"c":1},{"h":0.019211228800886992,"c":1,"t":"Do the following statements agree with the information given in Reading Passage 1?","y":0.18411044905306007,"w":0.69563217163085944,"x":0.17894731631590047},{"c":1,"x":0.17901234274729338,"y":0.21643109531049831,"t":"In boxes 9-13 on your answer sheet, write","w":0.35185185750325521,"h":0.014723203769140158},{"w":0.053497943878173831,"t":"TRUE","h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.24709302307285319,"x":0.24074074001564558,"c":1},{"t":"FALSE","h":0.013395540846250609,"y":0.26292432257707088,"c":1,"x":0.24067476239125474,"w":0.061860351562499971},{"c":1,"w":0.36232686360677091,"h":0.016834326430681279,"t":"if the statement agrees with the information","x":0.35793369659184404,"y":0.24549252616015416},{"t":"if the statement contradicts the information","h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"y":0.2614840990166265,"w":0.35596707661946614,"x":0.35802469504417633},{"h":0.014534883982160629,"c":1,"w":0.38065844217936196,"x":0.24074073765402546,"y":0.27761627893509222,"t":"NOT GIVEN if there is no information on this"},{"t":"9 Children with good self-control are known to be likely to do well at school later on.","y":0.31684334488743526,"w":0.71399175008138016,"h":0.016005492463128768,"c":1,"x":0.17695474213602835},{"x":0.17688728614842925,"w":0.70794326782226569,"h":0.017856886586255616,"t":"10 The way a child plays may provide information about possible medical problems.","c":1,"y":0.33909831290819969},{"h":0.015991796172268979,"c":1,"t":"11 Playing with dolls was found to benefit girls' writing more than boys' writing.","y":0.36336866907969267,"w":0.66049382527669265,"x":0.17901234668161248},{"w":0.64208643595377612,"c":1,"t":"12 Children had problems thinking up ideas when they first created the story","x":0.17896705887690806,"y":0.38754360728600257,"h":0.015994578564827},{"y":0.40457082500045338,"w":0.093546625773111985,"c":1,"x":0.21559797094345337,"h":0.014226628136157382,"t":"with Lego."},{"c":1,"y":0.42726737342934462,"t":"13 People nowadays regard children's play as less significant than they did in the past.","x":0.18106996665755731,"h":0.014723203769140158,"w":0.72633743286132812},{"y":0.86918604634899632,"h":0.011627907185728592,"x":0.88271604948587612,"c":1,"w":0.024691357612609877,"t":"19"}]}